  evidence:
  - evidence_type: LLM_SUGGESTION
    source: https://www.diagnostics-eu.shimadzu.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/culture-media-catalogue.pdf
    notes: NBRC848 specifies Nissui58g dry BL base before adding horse blood. Successor
      supplier catalogue p7 independently confirms58g/L powder and separate5% horse
      blood. This product is distinct from the JCM13 finished blood-containing medium
      and generic BL_Agar owner.
