    notes: Current nominal product recipe at58g/L. Partial transcription excludes
      two source phosphate rows both labelled the same monopotassium/dihydrogen species
      at1g and the undefined0.2g antifoam (source spelling Bubblke absorbong agent
      (Silicon)); source does not establish their exact identities. Horse blood is
      added separately and not included. Sulfate hydration forms remain unspecified;
      original Manganese sulftae spelling preserved.
